    "statement": "The MA holder shall provide for including the black isosceles triangle symbol with accompanying information on additional monitoring status in the SmPC and package insert of medicinal products on the list of products subject to additional monitoring.",
    "quote": "1027. The MA holder shall:\n      а) provide for including the symbol of a black isosceles triangle ( )\nwith accompanying information on the status of additional monitoring in the\nsummary of the medicinal product characteristics and the package insert of\nthe medicinal products included in the list of medicinal products subject to\nadditional monitoring;",
